Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're said to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to thank for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,a zombie's only purpose\Nis to serve its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,i made you and i can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,unmake you just as easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems as if the original owner\Nof the body is fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah but that person\Ndied over 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean a body without\Na soul can still have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,a will of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,who can really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,even if we read every book in\Nevery library in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,we
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill both of them. There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Century I know in lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to have you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to buy me some time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hell out of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,here! It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For a moment, I actually\Nthought a miracle had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time It's time for dos et Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it sounds like\Noars has finally returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid pirate deer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you siding with a\Ncorpse instead of a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even human to begin with, so\Nwhat the hell do you even care, you monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain of our crew is just\Nfine with monsters like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And mossheads and\Nperverts and cyborgs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of us get along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And unlike you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,our captain doesn't\Nneed to turn people into
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,zombie slaves to get them to listen to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pierre Nafleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I suddenly feel\Nas if I'm walking on air?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out, Dr. Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to consider the\Nconsequences here for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you splatter my genius brains\Nall over the floor right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd be doing a disservice\Nto the medical community.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That genius brain of yours is\Neven more rotten than your zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a man of reason, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we work something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Robin Chopper Suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's even bigger than a\Ngiant. Is that really my zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've kept me waiting haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whores it seems your body and\Nshadow have finally fused properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you'll be obedient from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,let's find out answer\Nme who is your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gecko Moria you are my master!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell do\Nyou think you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were\Nsupposed to be my shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to listen\Nto this guy, he sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with that dumb hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that everything is in order,\Nlet me give you your first mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These dastardly fellows are causing a\Nruckus on your poor master's island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called the Straw Hat pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush every last one of them and\Nthen put them back on their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill one or two\Nof them it's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides the bounties are\Nover a hundred million so
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,they won't fall apart after\Na few punches even from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see every ounce of your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay you got it, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, found one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Straw Hat. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.26,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that's Luffy's zombie! Oh, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor's going to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, over here, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,is Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogbeck and Shandora\Nfell to the floor below,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't look like they're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.16,0:07:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Century, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and move this rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny, Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need your help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours is going to crush me\Nlike a giant cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm far too smart to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have so much left to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your master, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there? Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My body won't move. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The only will a zombie has\Nis the will to follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So hurry up and save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\Ncorpse with a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm dyin' here, Century!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Boris is gonna stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAAHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's like down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're stepping down at!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, you oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd still be dead in a block of ice\Nright now if it wasn't for my genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That last tremor was one thing, but this\Nfeels like the whole mansion's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Loopy Zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that thing Luffy's zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, hey, now would be\Na good time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm just gonna have to run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're still alive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to finish this,\Nstop hiding and bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That troublemaking giant is\Nfinally under our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be taking my\Nbride for good this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You give Nami back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you hiding her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, are you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you play with Oz here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of giant monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be Luffy's zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else came out of the building\Nand it looks like Chef Curly Brows!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get stomped on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you running from your\Nshadow or chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant monster me is gonna be a problem But\Nif I wanna get everyone's shadows back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm gonna have to\Nbeat you anyway, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So get back here! Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, but it looks like\Nthe last laugh belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take her someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be in private, but\Nwe'll have our wedding yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My sleeping beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Mistress Perona all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed out, but it doesn't\Nlook like she was injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Captain Cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the long-nosed guy purify him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This mansion's as good as done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We can let the special zombie take\Ncare of the Straw Hats for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is rough, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here, like, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The special zombie's going on a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm showing back to my grave! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taller than the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just stomping over everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Luffy zombie has our faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, I mean on his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He has our wanted posters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your zombie's gonna be\Na real pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:14:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain, you're not gonna\Ntear apart your own crew, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he's been given the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope the real Luffy is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat me, I'm all bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we supposed to fight that damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Merde!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get me, Straw Hat! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put this dead end here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it occur to you that I'm\Nkeeping you busy chasing after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, while your entire crew gets\Nslaughtered by your own shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this you down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Franky too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, Brooke is with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're standing in my damn way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you doing interfering?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Orz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this that moron's picking a fight\Nwith the monster that damn stupid cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he even rescued Nami yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's in worse\Ntrouble than she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandy's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression That all\Nthey wanted from us were our shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But he looks more primed for violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess They decided they already got the\Ncream of the crop with Luffy's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we can Fight that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,look
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just the same
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,as your wanted poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But you admit you're part of\Nthe pirate. The crew, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, one of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.07,0:16:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, can he stretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he get Luffy's rubber\Npowers with his shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, he didn't stretch,\Nbut does it really matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With that strength and with as long as his\Nreach is, it's basically the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I recognized that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him, the demon from the legends,\NIt's once known as the Continent Polar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ko-ya-yay-free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How can something that big move that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachi, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Pyreng!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Splishing time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Firebird star!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.81,0:17:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tall woman with black hair,\Nthat's the little fuzzy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad Franky we gotta\Ndo something drawn this way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this will get his attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on! I gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys get down to the lower roof fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One gorilla, two gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style, double gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw! Holy crap! What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that punch didn't kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way he can survive\Nfalling from that height!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He dodged it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he be that angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeleton guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Saro's falling towards us! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll die if he hits the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Donut blue, add spider in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be huge, but\Nyou're still a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Soul Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he has gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's not Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Member, Moria's servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Ours?
